e how you approach the chaos!Play and Share Your FeedbackOnce the demo goes live today, download it from our Steam store page and jump in.After playing, visit the Steam discussions to share your impressions, report any bugs, a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T09:27:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943479","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:54:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4978260-1846018067933288","game_id":"steam-4978260","kind":"announcement","title":"SHEEP HAPPENS - Dev Log","summary":"From stealing livestock to sabotaging the water supply, these missions give both sides new ways to compete—and new reasons to keep an eye on each other.Cave Raid — Steal, Protect, Rescue!The wolves must capture marked sheep and pigs and carry them to their caves. The shepherd must protect the targeted animals and rescue those that have been captured.To help players follow the action, we’ve added:Objective guidance to direct players toward their targets.Alerts when animals are stolen, helping the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T13:22:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933288","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:54:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4978260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:10Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:09Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4978260":"2026-10-26T15:59:10Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4978260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:09Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:09Z"},"5346860":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26